"management","s":"Eric Hession","x":"While we continue to identify and pursue additional marketing efficiency programs, we do not expect to generate the same level of marketing cost savings in 2019 as we did in 2018 companywide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2019 Q1","e":"czr","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Rodio","x":"The company has made substantial progress since the conclusion of the restructuring, and I look forward to identifying and working toward additional growth opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/caesars-entertainment-czr-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2019 Q1","e":"czr","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Hession","x":"While the majority of the labor-related cost savings that we achieved in recent years has been driven at the property level, where we've reduced headcount by approximately 12% since 2014, in March we, completed a corporate cost-reduction initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/caesars-entertainment-czr-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2019 Q2","e":"czr","d":"2019-08-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Tony Rodio","x":"Between The Colosseum and Zappos Theater, we will feature several high-profile entertainers, including Christina Aguilera, Gwen Stefani, Guns N' Roses, Journey, Madonna and Shania Twain, among others.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/caesars-entertainment-czr-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2019 Q2","e":"czr","d":"2019-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Adam","x":"Tony, I think you remarked on it just before, but the cost reduction efforts with an anticipation of -- or ahead of the closing of the Eldorado acquisition, where do you currently stand?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/caesars-entertainment-czr-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2019 Q4","e":"czr","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Rodio","x":"In terms of corporate, it's come from a number of areas, just through attrition, we did that voluntary severance plan where we eliminated our pursuit of the license in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/caesars-entertainment-czr-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2019 Q4","e":"czr","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Hession","x":"And when we put our budget together, we estimate those and then try to find ways to offset them through cost savings in other areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/caesars-entertainment-czr-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q1","e":"czr","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Rodio","x":"In an effort to strengthen the company's financial position and enhance our ability to recover and we do reopen, we made the extremely difficult but necessary decision to temporarily reduce our workforce to a smaller, targeted workforce on maintaining basic operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/caesars-entertainment-czr-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q1","e":"czr","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Rodio","x":"First and foremost, we had taken over $120 million worth of cost out of the business on an annual run-rate basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/caesars-entertainment-czr-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q2","e":"czr","d":"2020-08-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Tom Reeg","x":"As those other options movie theaters, cruise lines, sporting events, as those come online, you have more options.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q2","e":"czr","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bret Yunker","x":"Based on current operating trends, and the execution of incremental cost savings, we expect to end the year with the bulk of that excess cash on hand, and zero balance on the revolvers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q2","e":"czr","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Reeg","x":"And at closing, Caesars had executed on about $200 million of the original $400 million of cost saving.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q3","e":"czr","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Reeg","x":"Our run rate cost reduction is about $2 billion from pre-COVID levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CZR 2020 Q3","e":"czr","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Reeg","x":"…a minimum, its enjoyable from my seat to see our peers in this space reporting the same types of cost savings opportunities that we've been talking about for many years and to see Las Vegas locals margins in excess of 40% for the quarter and a couple of our peers, that's a roadmap to what's…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CZR 2021 Q1","e":"czr","d":"2021-05-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Thomas R. Reeg","x":"So I don't spend a lot of time worrying that what happens when you can go to a movie theater or get on a cruise ship.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/caesars-entertainment-corp-czr-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"CZR 2021 Q1","e":"czr","d":"2021-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas R. Reeg","x":"I think that this is 